<p>Conjures up a bolt of fire that moves toward the target and explodes into a flash of fire, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">204, 274, 329, 375, 416</acronym> fire damage in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>